{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X的感受文字密度明显偏高，尤其S03、S04、S07等较短时段，扫读时容易被大量碎片信息牵扯，Y的左右分栏更容易迅速定位。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的优势是版面分工稳定、叙述完整，普通观众更容易迅速扫过，但部分长句需要连续阅读，右侧感受词也有些泛化。X用重点放大和简短叙述，让人物每一阶段的核心矛盾更容易被抓住，而且从怀念被当作自己人的温暖、不愿重新忍受委屈，到接受想念并继续生活，前后心理变化衔接得更细致。尤其X的音乐感受有更多具体的音型、力度、节奏和情绪转折描述，并且部分内容按音乐时点出现，实际听感与人物心理的对应更丰富；综合而言，X更能让观众感到这是一段有来由、有反复、有变化的完整心路历程。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b179b018-57ad-4a30-bc9d-058841a06b00", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T002730839830Z", "elapsed_seconds": 50.594, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:28:21.446873+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "561bc556636131bec249671e23428896c6d2789957e6e53ba4780b0ad6e0eb09", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0